  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds caller-issued change labels to MappedTextDiff, including inert labels, emphasis, visible-whitespace control, related-change addresses, format-specific rendering, and structured provenance fields. Adds per-operation streaming sessions for TSV and JSONL tables and for Trees: rows and nodes reach the destination immediately without retaining the full shape; shared formatter instances keep table headers, ancestor state, and Mermaid node IDs isolated; pretty tables retain their width-aware buffered path; and retained and streamed Tree output remain byte-compatible across built-in formatters. Adds JsonLinesWriter.WriteRows<T> for incrementally serializing fixed-shape JSONL records with source-generated metadata. A state-carrying Tree node callback avoids per-parent closure allocations for hot adapters.",
